From efe0ba7f0f5b7779a7edd9ee80e1a5285be9ea79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <168627+NeoTech@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:40:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] fix(pathkernel): the entry stage keeps the reason of
 each refused try

Each .ok() on a checked constructor of an entry try goes through Ctx::checked: the reason is a note of the entry that fits, or Refusal::after / tried() of the final refusal. A geometry error of the room tests is a refusal. A cut above the material top names ABOVE in a note or the named fallback.

Refs #4407
Refs #4383

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
